OL,3,AThe teen entrepreneur transforming farm
OL,4,Amanagement
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager from County Down hopes an
OL,7,Fapp he has developed will revolutionise
OL,8,Fhow farms are run, giving hard-pressed
OL,9,Ffarmers more time.
OL,11,FBen O'Connor, 16, was inspired when his
OL,12,Ffamily's farm near Castlewellan moved
OL,13,Ffrom beef to a dairy operation.
OL,15,FThat meant longer hours, strict routine
OL,16,Fand more tasks to schedule, all of
OL,17,Fwhich reduced the time his family had
OL,18,Ftogether.
